Package: molelinux
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), pkexec | policykit-1, polkitd | policykit-1
Recommends: apt, systemd, desktop-file-utils
Maintainer: MoleLinux Project <maintainers@localhost>
Homepage: https://github.com/tw93/mole
Description: Safe cleanup and maintenance toolkit for Ubuntu
 MoleLinux adapts Mole's cleanup, reviewed application removal, disk analysis,
 system status, batch application removal and maintenance workflows to
 Ubuntu, XDG directories, dpkg/APT, Flatpak and systemd.
